<title>UK: BAe rebounds as brokers repeat &quot;buy&quot;.</title>
<headline>BAe rebounds as brokers repeat &quot;buy&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in British Aerospace Plc rebounded on Thursday, recovering more than half of their Wednesday losses as several brokers repeated &quot;buy&quot; recommendations.</p>
<p>By 0944 GMT, the shares were up 11-1/2p to 1264-1/2p.</p>
